{"type":"Film","id":"FR2016_017","slug":"fr2016-017-chocolat","title":{"native":"Chocolat","english":"Monsieur Chocolat"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2016-02-03","year":2016},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"Roschdy Zem","slug":"roschdy-zem","name":"Roschdy Zem","birthYear":1965,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[{"film":{"slug":"fr2022-143-l-innocent","title":{"native":"L'Innocent"}},"year":2023,"award":"César du cinéma","category":"Best Supporting Actor","result":"Nominated"}]}],"genre":["Biopic"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/133/87/153477/format_page/chocolat.jpg","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oS_VOZHAMl0"},"synopsis":{"native":"Du cirque au théâtre, de l’anonymat à la gloire, l’incroyable destin du clown Chocolat), premier artiste noir de la scène française. Le duo inédit qu’il forme avec Footit, va rencontrer un immense succès populaire dans le Paris de la Belle époque avant que la célébrité, l’argent facile, le jeu et les discriminations n’usent leur amitié et la carrière de Chocolat. Le film retrace l’histoire de cet artiste hors du commun.","english":"From the circus to the music hall, from anonymity to glory, this is the incredible story of Monsieur Chocolat, the first black artist of the French stage. The duo he formed with Footit met with huge and popular success in Belle Epoque Paris, before fame, easy money, gambling, and discrimination wore out their friendship and Monsieur Chocolat's career. The film retraces the story of this remarkable artist."},"production":[{"country":"France","share":"Majority coproducer"}],"characters":[],"roles":[{"person":{"id":"Alex Descas","slug":"alex-descas","name":"Alex Descas","birthYear":1958,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Minor actor/Cameo"},{"person":{"id":"Frédéric Pierrot","slug":"frederic-pierrot","name":"Frédéric Pierrot","birthYear":1960,"death